& [Fold1Identity]
  + local development verifier not product runtime
  + one repository one WSL distribution one stable target and one declared action

& [Fold2Boundary]
  + inside is plan preflight test or Clippy invocation and exit status
  + outside is cleanup remote access OneDrive mutation deployment and background work

& [Fold3Data]
  + input is action distribution target minimum free GiB and explicit execute flag
  + output is a JSON plan or the selected subprocess result

& [Fold4Flow]
  + resolve repository and Windows volume
  + validate closed inputs and capacity
  + emit plan
  + when selected verify WSL distribution and execute one serialized Cargo lane

& [Fold5Faults]
  + invalid action path threshold distribution or missing WSL refuses before Cargo
  + insufficient space refuses without cleanup
  + child failure propagates its exit status

& [Fold6Evidence]
  + offline tests inspect default plan execution plan low-space refusal and unknown action refusal
  + existing full workspace test and Clippy commands establish compatibility

& [Fold7Pruning]
  - no automatic deletion
  - no per-run target allocation
  - no SSH network drive OneDrive or EVO-X2
  - no background scheduling or product authority

